authored by this project.

2010 Rust Rewrite Mashup is a fork of IW4L by chasmlol that adds Skate 3's
skating and a Minecraft world to it.
https://github.com/chasmlol/2010-rust-rewrite-mashup

This repository is now the Rust PC skate mod. The IW4L and mashup engine
sources were removed from main on 25 October 2026 and remain in the git tag
archive/mw2-rewrite. The xtask publish-check and the repository scripts are
derived from IW4L and keep its Apache-2.0 licence.

