Third-party source code
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The project's Apache-2.0 licence applies to its own code only; it does not
relicense the material below:

mods/rust/client/generator/interop/pointer-byref.patch — a two-predicate
  correction to BepInEx/Il2CppInterop, source revision
  dbda1cb353b0f4253345dc45136d170b9e50a5a0.
  https://github.com/BepInEx/Il2CppInterop
  The modified library source remains LGPL-3.0-only; full LGPL/GPL texts and
  modification attribution are in that directory's UPSTREAM-LICENSE and
  MODIFICATIONS-LICENSE. The separate project-authored recipe/configuration
  remains Apache-2.0. The recipe stages the original upstream source archive,
  exact patch and build inputs alongside its Generator candidate; no upstream
  DLL, generated client assembly or proprietary game file is committed here.

mods/rust/shared/SkateAudio.cs — original project-authored procedural audio.
  Wheel, truck/deck-contact and event PCM is generated from seeded oscillators,
